{"3402320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Killer Eyelashes", "steam_appid": 3402320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The apocalypse is here...and it's beat for the gods!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How likely was it that your debut as a drag artist would be overshadowed by a zombie apocalypse? No one expected it, but overnight the world is full of paint-splattered zombies invading the streets in search of new victims to make up and convert. For some reason, drags with their excess of infected make-up have acquired superpowers and are now humanity's only salvation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative and unforgettable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths, endings and narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't lose your dignity in turn-based narrative combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that will be easier the more you know about the world and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing art by Sophia Isome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/42aa5b50ad4f6f8adce1946d83972bfa.avif?t=1761819434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras_big/42aa5b50ad4f6f8adce1946d83972bfa.avif?t=1761819434 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a word full of zombies and, of course, drag queens, <strong>you can trust no one</strong>. You better investigate and get all the clues and secrets from the characters. You will unlock their traits and make it easier to progress through the story... or you can just go ahead and face whatever comes your way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catfight your enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/c1338968815800d9542850786e46c450.poster.avif?t=1761819434\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/c1338968815800d9542850786e46c450.webm?t=1761819434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/c1338968815800d9542850786e46c450.mp4?t=1761819434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no health bar in Killer Eyelashes... there is a dignity bar!</strong> If you lose all your dignity, you are worse than dead. You will defeat your enemies in catfights: a type of narrative combat in which you’ll have to overcome your enemy’s <i>shades</i> with the best response. To win the catfight, you must deplete your opponent’s dignity bar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lipsyncs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on an amazing show. You know the words… <i>right? </i>Compose your song and try to match what the audience wants to hear to get the best score. Whether you make it perfect or a complete disaster. It will definitely be fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big purse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/01fc572b8c8b9d65a22e48d2b216e105.poster.avif?t=1761819434\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/01fc572b8c8b9d65a22e48d2b216e105.webm?t=1761819434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/01fc572b8c8b9d65a22e48d2b216e105.mp4?t=1761819434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find all sorts of items and gadgets during your adventure – save them! You might need them at some point.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The apocalypse is here...and it's beat for the gods!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How likely was it that your debut as a drag artist would be overshadowed by a zombie apocalypse? No one expected it, but overnight the world is full of paint-splattered zombies invading the streets in search of new victims to make up and convert. For some reason, drags with their excess of infected make-up have acquired superpowers and are now humanity's only salvation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative and unforgettable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths, endings and narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't lose your dignity in turn-based narrative combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that will be easier the more you know about the world and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing art by Sophia Isome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras/42aa5b50ad4f6f8adce1946d83972bfa.avif?t=1761819434\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/extras_big/42aa5b50ad4f6f8adce1946d83972bfa.avif?t=1761819434 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a word full of zombies and, of course, drag queens, <strong>you can trust no one</strong>. You better investigate and get all the clues and secrets from the characters. You will unlock their traits and make it easier to progress through the story... or you can just go ahead and face whatever comes your way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catfight your enemies</h2><p class=\"