/span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find all sorts of items and gadgets during your adventure – save them! You might need them at some point.</p>", "short_description": "The apocalypse is here… and its beat for the gods! How likely was your debut as a drag artist to be overshadowed by a zombie apocalypse? Meet quirky characters, solve puzzles, and catfight with your rivals in this fresh narrative adventure.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/b00375bdc17f2d23061ca821d603e42fee056b57/header.jpg?t=1761819434", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/efcfe3c158612591f2b7196fcb2fb413a2598048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761819434", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402320/efcfe3c158612591f2b7196fcb2fb413a2598048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761819434", "website": "https://tiamat.studio/killer-eyelashes/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs\t<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><l